<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Sonae shares fall.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Sonae shares fall.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailer and real estate concern Sonae Investimentos fell nearly three percent to 5,590 escudos on Friday, apparently on the basis of one large seller in the market.</p>
<p>&quot;There is one big seller who is driving the price down. I don't know if it is profit-taking after the strong recent gains,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>Sonae had surged to a high for the year of 5,930 escudos after the group split away its industrial and media interests into a new group  Inparsa.</p>
<p>The share price was above an early Friday low of 5,512 escudos. ($1=169.43 escudos)</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
